 0，然后 `WHERE deck_id = 0` 不会匹配任何记录，但由于某些原因它返回了所有卡片。\\n\\n让我仔细看一下代码：```javascript\\nconst deckId = req.query.deck ? parseInt(req.query.deck) : null;if (deckId) {  // 如果 deckId 是 0，这个条件是 false！\\n  cards = db.prepare(`...`).all(deckId);\\n} else {  cards = db.prepare(`...`).all();\\n}\\n```\\n\\n问题在于 `if (deckId)` - 当 `deckId = 0` 时，JavaScript 会将其视为 falsy 值，所以会执行 else 分支，返回所有卡片！这不是\\\"加载失败\\\"的问题，但可能导致意外行为。让我想想用户报告的真正问题...用户说\\\"加载失败\\\"。让我检查一下前端代码可能出错的地方。\\n\\n等等，让我检查添加卡片后是否数据库正确保存了 deck_id：\",\"thinkingSignature\":\"0ad01c02aa82bb2614bbed82e4abec1c608f159ec839285f344cc539aa2dfdac\"},{\"type\":\"toolCall\",\"id\":\"call_function_uwopx973qsji_1\",\"name\":\"exec\",\"arguments\":{\"command\":\"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3001/api/cards \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json\\\" \\\\\\n  -d '{\\\"question\\\":\\\"测试问题\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"测试答案\\\",\\\"deck_id\\\":3}'\"}}],\"api\":\"anthropic-messages\",\"provider\":\"minimax-portal\",\"model\":\"MiniMax-M2.5\",\"usage\":{\"input\":18610,\"output\":277,\"cacheRead\":7777,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"totalTokens\":26664,\"cost\":{\"input\":0,\"output\":0,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"total\":0}},\"stopReason\":\"toolUse\",\"timestamp\":1772158285047}}\n{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"5af0c49b\",\"parentId\":\"75634fa7\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-02-27T02:11:39.598Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"toolResult\",\"toolCallId\":\"call_function_uwopx973qsji_1\",\"toolName\":\"exec\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\\"success\\\":true,\\\"data\\\":{\\\"id\\\":19,\\\"question\\\":\\\"测试问题\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"测试答案\\\",\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-02-27T02:11:39.588Z\\\",\\\"due_date\\\":\\\"2026-02-27T02:11:39.588Z\\\",\\\"interval\\\":0,\\\"ease_factor\\\":2.5,\\\"repetitions\\\":0,\\\"lapses\\\":0,\\\"state\\\":\\\"new\\\",\\\"last_review\\\":null,\\\"deck_id\\\":3}}\"}],\"details\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"exitCode\":0,\"durationMs\":25,\"aggregated\":\"{\\\"success\\\":true,\\\"data\\\":{\\\"id\\\":19,\\\"ques