emory/web/public/app.js`：\\n\\n1. **修复 loadDueCards 错误处理**（约第 389-395 行）：\\n```javascript\\n// Handle API error response\\nif (!result.success) {\\n  console.error('API error:', result.error);\\n  showToast(result.error || '加载失败', 'error');\\n  return;\\n}\\n```\\n\\n2. **添加卡片后自动刷新复习列表**（addCard 函数，约第 696-700 行）：\\n```javascript\\n// Refresh due cards if in study view to show newly added card\\nif (currentView === 'study') {\\n  loadDueCards();\\n}\\n```\\n\\n3. **quickAdd 函数也添加了同样的刷新逻辑**\\n\\n## 测试结果\\n\\n- ✅ 创建新牌组成功\\n- ✅ 添加卡片到新牌组成功\\n- ✅ 牌组待复习数量正确更新\\n- ✅ 复习 API 返回正确的待复习卡片\\n- ✅ 前端现在会显示错误信息（如果 API 返回错误）\\n- ✅ 添加卡片后会自动刷新复习列表\"}],\"api\":\"anthropic-messages\",\"provider\":\"minimax-portal\",\"model\":\"MiniMax-M2.5\",\"usage\":{\"input\":44389,\"output\":335,\"cacheRead\":7777,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"totalTokens\":52501,\"cost\":{\"input\":0,\"output\":0,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"total\":0}},\"stopReason\":\"stop\",\"timestamp\":1772158771231}}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":22,"aggregated":"{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"ae1c2752\",\"parentId\":\"24c7395f\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-02-27T02:07:51.822Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"toolResult\",\"toolCallId\":\"call_function_iho1veurgiek_1\",\"toolName\":\"exec\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/node_modules/better-sqlite3/lib/database.js:65\\n\\t\\tthrow new TypeError('Cannot open database because the directory does not exist');\\n\\t\\t^\\n\\nTypeError: Cannot open database because the directory does not exist\\n    at new Database (/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/node_modules/better-sqlite3/lib/database.js:65:9)\\n    at [eval]:3:12\\n    at runScriptInThisContext (node:internal/vm:209:10)\\n    at node:internal/process/execution:446:12\\n    at [eval]-wrapper:6:24\\n    at runScriptInContext (node:internal/process/execution:444:60)\\n    at evalFunction (node:internal/process/execution:279:30)\\n    at evalTypeScript (nod