e\":\"toolResult\",\"toolCallId\":\"call_function_zttixa4j9v2d_1\",\"toolName\":\"exec\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"=== 获取所有待复习卡片 ===\\n{\\\"success\\\":true,\\\"data\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":21,\\\"question\\\":\\\"时区测试问题\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"时区测试答案\\\",\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-02-27T02:14:39.497Z\\\",\\\"due_date\\\":\\\"2026-02-27T02:14:39.497Z\\\",\\\"interval\\\":0,\\\"ease_factor\\\":2.5,\\\"repetitions\\\":0,\\\"lapses\\\":0,\\\"state\\\":\\\"new\\\",\\\"last_review\\\":null,\\\"deck_id\\\":1},{\\\"id\\\":23,\\\"question\\\":\\\"测试问题1\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"测试答案1\\\",\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-02-27T02:16:09.243Z\\\",\\\"due_date\\\":\\\"2026-02-27T02:16:09.243Z\\\",\\\"interval\\\":0,\\\"ease_factor\\\":2.5,\\\"repetitions\\\":0,\\\"lapses\\\":0,\\\"state\\\":\\\"new\\\",\\\"last_review\\\":null,\\\"deck_id\\\":6}]}\\n\\n=== 获取特定牌组的待复习卡片 (deck=6) ===\\n{\\\"success\\\":true,\\\"data\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":23,\\\"question\\\":\\\"测试问题1\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"测试答案1\\\",\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-02-27T02:16:09.243Z\\\",\\\"due_date\\\":\\\"2026-02-27T02:16:09.243Z\\\",\\\"interval\\\":0,\\\"ease_factor\\\":2.5,\\\"repetitions\\\":0,\\\"lapses\\\":0,\\\"state\\\":\\\"new\\\",\\\"last_review\\\":null,\\\"deck_id\\\":6}]}\\n\\n=== 获取统计信息 ===\\n{\\\"success\\\":true,\\\"data\\\":{\\\"total\\\":6,\\\"due\\\":2,\\\"reviewed\\\":4,\\\"new\\\":2,\\\"learning\\\":0,\\\"avgEase\\\":2.5}}\"}],\"details\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"exitCode\":0,\"durationMs\":31,\"aggregated\":\"=== 获取所有待复习卡片 ===\\n{\\\"success\\\":true,\\\"data\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":21,\\\"question\\\":\\\"时区测试问题\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"时区测试答案\\\",\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-02-27T02:14:39.497Z\\\",\\\"due_date\\\":\\\"2026-02-27T02:14:39.497Z\\\",\\\"interval\\\":0,\\\"ease_factor\\\":2.5,\\\"repetitions\\\":0,\\\"lapses\\\":0,\\\"state\\\":\\\"new\\\",\\\"last_review\\\":null,\\\"deck_id\\\":1},{\\\"id\\\":23,\\\"question\\\":\\\"测试问题1\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"测试答案1\\\",\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-02-27T02:16:09.243Z\\\",\\\"due_date\\\":\\\"2026-02-27T02:16:09.243Z\\\",\\\"interval\\\":0,\\\"ease_factor\\\":2.5,\\\"repetitions\\\":0,\\\"lapses\\\":0,\\\"state\\\":\\\"new\\\",\\\"last_review\\\":null,\\\"deck_id\\\":6}]}\\n\\n=== 获取特定牌组的待复习卡片 (deck=6) ===\\n{\\\"success\\\":true,\\\"data\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":23,\\\"question\\\":\\\"测试问题1\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"测试答案1\\\",\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-02-27T02:16:09.243Z\\\",\\\"due_date\\\":\\\"2026-02-27T02:16:09.243Z\\\",\\\"interval\\\":0,\\\"ease_factor\\\":2.5,\\\"repetitions\\\":0,\\\"lapses\\\":0,\\\"state\\\":\\\"new\\\",\\\"last_review\\\":null,\\\"deck_id\\\":6}]}\\n\\n=== 获取统计信息 ===\\n{\\\"success\\\":true,\\\"data\\\":{\\\"total\\\":6,\\\"due\\\":2,\\\"reviewed\\\":4,\\\"new\\\":2,\\\"learning\\\":0,\\\"avgEase\\\":2.5}}\",\"cwd\":\"/home/one/.openclaw/agents/leader-agent\"},\"isError\":false,\"timestamp\":1772158586980}}\n{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"081f5246\",\"parentId\":\"89252216\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-02-27T02:16:34.760Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"所有 API 都正常工作！卡片已经正确添加到复习队列中。\\n\\n现在让我总结一下我的发现：1. 服务器 API 正常工作2. 添加卡片后，due_count 正确更新3. 复习 API 返回正确的待复习卡片\\n\\n这意味着用户报告的问题可能是：1. 之前存在的问题现在已经修复2. 用户操作问题（没有选择正确的牌组）3. 前端的错误处理需要改进让我检查一下是否需要修复什么。我注意到一个问题：在 `loadDueCards` 函数中，没有处理 `result.success === false` 的情况。让我修复这个问题，同时也改进添加卡片后的刷新逻辑。\",\"thinkingSignature\":\"12efa681f12e02b34370c507aa23b3f35bb612197ac4b9982ae7794a24b3d6a8\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"经过测试，我发现后端 API 完全正常工作。问题可能出在前端的错误处理逻辑上。让我检查并修复前端的两个问题：\\n\\n1. `loadDueCards` 没有处理 API 返回 `success: false` 的情况\\n2. 添加卡片后没有自动刷新复习列表\\n\"},{\"type\":\"toolCall\",\"id\":\"call_function_ey50m6dko5uv_1\",\"name\":\"read\",\"arguments\":{\"limit\":30,\"offset\":372,\"path\":\"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/public/app.js\"}}],\"api\":\"anthropic-messages\",\"provider\":\"minimax-portal\",\"model\":\"MiniMax-M2.5\",\"usage\":{\"input\":29266,\"output\":242,\"cacheRead\":7777,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"totalTokens\":37285,\"cost\":{\"input\":0,\"output\":0,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"total\":0}},\"stopReason\":\"toolUse\",\"timestamp\":1772158586984}}\n{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"c52254d1\",\"parentId\":\"081f5246\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-02-27T02:16:34.782Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"toolResult\",\"toolCallId\":\"call_function_ey50m6dko5uv_1\",\"toolName\":\"read\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"async function loadDueCards() {\\n  try {\\n    let url = `${API_BASE}/api/cards/due`;\\n    if (currentDeckId) {\\n      url += `?deck=${currentDeckId}`;\\n    }\\n    \\n    const response = await fetch(url);\\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    \\n    if (result.success) {\\n      dueCards = result.data;\\n      currentCardIndex = 0;\\n      isAnswerShown = false;\\n      updateStudyProgress();\\n      \\n      if (dueCards.length > 0) {\\n        showCard();\\n      } else {\\n        showEmptyState();\\n      }\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to load due cards:', error);\\n    showToast('加载失败', 'error');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction updateStudyProgress() {\\n  const studied = currentCardIndex;\\n\\n[463 more lines in file. Use offset=402 to continue.]\"}],\"isError\":false,\"timestamp\":1772158594778}}\n{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"3079c15e\",\"parentId\":\"c52254d1\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-02-27T02:16:54.028Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"我发现了问题！`loadDueCards` 没有处理 `result.success === false` 的情况。让我修复这个：\",\"thinkingSignature\":\"5a242234d51e0fbb6c2db15cb75c7aa3ac876da03fec4a102ca13baadd27a053\"},{\"type\":\"toolCall\",\"id\":\"call_function_tgswvxw0z47r_1\",\"name\":\"read\",\"arguments\":{\"path\":\"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/public/app.js\"}}],\"api\":\"anthropic-messages\",\"provider\":\"minimax-portal\",\"model\":\"MiniMax-M2.5\",\"usage\":{\"input\":29709,\"output\":66,\"cacheRead\":7777,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"totalTokens\":37552,\"cost\":{\"input\":0,\"output\":0,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"total\":0}},\"stopReason\":\"toolUse\",\"timestamp\":1772158594782}}\n{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"e55595ab\",\"parentId\":\"3079c15e\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-02-27T02:16:54.052Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"toolResult\",\"toolCallId\":\"call_function_tgswvxw0z47r_1\",\"toolName\":\"read\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"// FSRS Memory Web UI - Application Logic with Multi-deck & Theme support\\n\\nconst API_BASE = window.location.origin;\\n\\n// State\\nlet currentView = 'study';\\nlet currentDeckId = null;\\nlet dueCards = [];\\nlet allCards = [];\\nlet allDecks = [];\\nlet currentCardIndex = 0;\\nlet currentCard = null;\\nlet isAnswerShown = false;\\nlet currentTheme = 'light';\\n\\n// ==================== Initialization ====================\\n\\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\\n  initTheme();\\n  initNavigation();\\n  initKeyboardShortcuts();\\n  loadDecks();\\n  loadStats();\\n  loadDueCards();\\n});\\n\\n// ==================== Theme ====================\\n\\nasync function initTheme() {\\n  try {\\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/settings/theme`);\\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    if (result.success) {\\n      currentTheme = result.data || 'light';\\n      applyTheme(currentTheme);\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to load theme:', error);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction applyTheme(theme) {\\n  document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', theme);\\n  document.getElementById('theme-icon').textContent = theme === 'dark' ? '☀️' : '🌙';\\n  currentTheme = theme;\\n}\\n\\nasync function toggleTheme() {\\n  const newTheme = currentTheme === 'light' ? 'dark' : 'light';\\n  try {\\n    await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/settings/theme`, {\\n      method: 'POST',\\n      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\\n      body: JSON.stringify({ theme: newTheme })\\n    });\\n    applyTheme(newTheme);\\n    showToast(`已切换到${newTheme === 'dark' ? '暗色' : '亮色'}主题`, 'success');\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to save theme:', error);\\n    showToast('主题切换失败', 'error');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n// ==================== Navigation ====================\\n\\nfunction initNavigation() {\\n  const navItems = document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item');\\n  navItems.forEach(item => {\\n    item.addEventListener('click', () => {\\n      const view = item.dataset.view;\\n      showView(view);\\n    });\\n  });\\n}\\n\\nfunction showView(view) {\\n  // Update nav\\n  document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item').forEach(item => {\\n    item.classList.toggle('active', item.dataset.view === view);\\n  });\\n  \\n  // Update view\\n  document.querySelectorAll('.view').forEach(v => {\\n    v.classList.toggle('active', v.id === `${view}-view`);\\n  });\\n  \\n  currentView = view;\\n  \\n  // Load data for specific views\\n  if (view === 'study') {\\n    loadDueCards();\\n  } else if (view === 'cards') {\\n    loadAllCards();\\n  } else if (view === 'decks') {\\n    loadDecksGrid();\\n  } else if (view === 'stats') {\\n    loadStats();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n// ==================== Deck Management ====================\\n\\nasync function loadDecks() {\\n  try {\\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/decks`);\\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    \\n    if (result.success) {\\n      allDecks = result.data;\\n      updateDeckSelectors();\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to load decks:', error);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction updateDeckSelectors() {\\n  // Update sidebar deck selector\\n  const sidebarSelect = document.getElementById('deck-select');\\n  const addViewSelect = document.getElementById('deck-select-add');\\n  \\n  const options = allDecks.map(deck => \\n    `<option value=\\\"${deck.id}\\\">${deck.name} (${deck.due_count || 0} 待复习)</option>`\\n  ).join('');\\n  \\n  sidebarSelect.innerHTML = '<option value=\\\"\\\">全部牌组</option>' + options;\\n  addViewSelect.innerHTML = options;\\n  \\n  // Set default selection\\n  if (allDecks.length > 0 && !currentDeckId) {\\n    addViewSelect.value = allDecks[0].id;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nasync function changeDeck(deckId) {\\n  currentDeckId = deckId ? parseInt(deckId) : null;\\n  \\n  // Update deck info in study view\\n  const deckInfo = document.getElementById('deck-info');\\n  if (currentDeckId) {\\n    const deck = allDecks.find(d => d.id === currentDeckId);\\n    deckInfo.textContent = `当前牌组: ${deck ? deck.name : ''}`;\\n  } else {\\n    deckInfo.textContent = '';\\n  }\\n  \\n  // Reload data\\n  if (currentView === 'study') {\\n    loadDueCards();\\n  } else if (currentView === 'cards') {\\n    loadAllCards();\\n  } else if (currentView === 'stats') {\\n    loadStats();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nasync function loadDecksGrid() {\\n  try {\\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/decks`);\\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    \\n    if (result.success) {\\n      renderDecksGrid(result.data);\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to load decks:', error);\\n    showToast('加载失败', 'error');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction renderDecksGrid(decks) {\\n  const container = document.getElementById('decks-grid');\\n  \\n  container.innerHTML = decks.map(deck => `\\n    <div class=\\\"deck-card\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"deck-card-header\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"deck-card-name\\\">${escapeHtml(deck.name)}</div>\\n        ${deck.id === 1 ? '<span class=\\\"deck-card-default\\\">默认</span>' : ''}\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"deck-card-desc\\\">${escapeHtml(deck.description || '暂无描述')}</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"deck-card-stats\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"deck-stat\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"deck-stat-value\\\">${deck.card_count || 0}</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"deck-stat-label\\\">卡片数</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"deck-stat\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"deck-stat-value\\\">${deck.due_count || 0}</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"deck-stat-label\\\">待复习</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"deck-card-actions\\\">\\n        <button class=\\\"btn btn-secondary btn-small\\\" onclick=\\\"showEditDeckModal(${deck.id})\\\">编辑</button>\\n        ${deck.id !== 1 ? `<button class=\\\"btn btn-danger btn-small\\\" onclick=\\\"confirmDeleteDeck(${deck.id})\\\">删除</button>` : ''}\\n        <button class=\\\"btn btn-primary btn-small\\\" onclick=\\\"selectDeckAndStudy(${deck.id})\\\">学习</button>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  `).join('');\\n}\\n\\nfunction showCreateDeckModal() {\\n  document.getElementById('deck-modal-title').textContent = '新建牌组';\\n  document.getElementById('deck-name-input').value = '';\\n  document.getElementById('deck-desc-input').value = '';\\n  document.getElementById('save-deck-btn').onclick = createDeck;\\n  document.getElementById('deck-modal').style.display = 'flex';\\n}\\n\\nfunction showEditDeckModal(deckId) {\\n  const deck = allDecks.find(d => d.id === deckId);\\n  if (!deck) return;\\n  \\n  document.getElementById('deck-modal-title').textContent = '编辑牌组';\\n  document.getElementById('deck-name-input').value = deck.name;\\n  document.getElementById('deck-desc-input').value = deck.description || '';\\n  document.getElementById('save-deck-btn').onclick = () => updateDeck(deckId);\\n  document.getElementById('deck-modal').style.display = 'flex';\\n}\\n\\nfunction closeDeckModal() {\\n  document.getElementById('deck-modal').style.display = 'none';\\n}\\n\\nasync function createDeck() {\\n  const name = document.getElementById('deck-name-input').value.trim();\\n  const description = document.getElementById('deck-desc-input').value.trim();\\n  \\n  if (!name) {\\n    showToast('请输入牌组名称', 'error');\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  \\n  try {\\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/decks`, {\\n      method: 'POST',\\n      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\\n      body: JSON.stringify({ name, description })\\n    });\\n    \\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    \\n    if (result.success) {\\n      showToast('牌组创建成功', 'success');\\n      closeDeckModal();\\n      loadDecks();\\n      loadDecksGrid();\\n    } else {\\n      showToast(result.error || '创建失败', 'error');\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to create deck:', error);\\n    showToast('创建失败', 'error');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nasync function updateDeck(deckId) {\\n  const name = document.getElementById('deck-name-input').value.trim();\\n  const description = document.getElementById('deck-desc-input').value.trim();\\n  \\n  if (!name) {\\n    showToast('请输入牌组名称', 'error');\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  \\n  try {\\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/decks/${deckId}`, {\\n      method: 'PUT',\\n      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\\n      body: JSON.stringify({ name, description })\\n    });\\n    \\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    \\n    if (result.success) {\\n      showToast('牌组更新成功', 'success');\\n      closeDeckModal();\\n      loadDecks();\\n      loadDecksGrid();\\n    } else {\\n      showToast(result.error || '更新失败', 'error');\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to update deck:', error);\\n    showToast('更新失败', 'error');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction confirmDeleteDeck(deckId) {\\n  if (confirm('确定要删除这个牌组吗？该牌组中的卡片将移动到默认牌组。')) {\\n    deleteDeck(deckId);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nasync function deleteDeck(deckId) {\\n  try {\\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/decks/${deckId}`, {\\n      method: 'DELETE'\\n    });\\n    \\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    \\n    if (result.success) {\\n      showToast('牌组已删除', 'success');\\n      loadDecks();\\n      loadDecksGrid();\\n      loadStats();\\n    } else {\\n      showToast(result.error || '删除失败', 'error');\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to delete deck:', error);\\n    showToast('删除失败', 'error');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction selectDeckAndStudy(deckId) {\\n  document.getElementById('deck-select').value = deckId;\\n  changeDeck(deckId);\\n  showView('study');\\n}\\n\\n// ==================== Keyboard Shortcuts ====================\\n\\nfunction initKeyboardShortcuts() {\\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\\n    // Don't trigger shortcuts when typing in inputs\\n    if (e.target.tagName === 'INPUT' || e.target.tagName === 'TEXTAREA' || e.target.tagName === 'SELECT') {\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    \\n    // Study view shortcuts\\n    if (currentView === 'study' && dueCards.length > 0) {\\n      if (!isAnswerShown) {\\n        // Space or Enter to show answer\\n        if (e.code === 'Space' || e.code === 'Enter') {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          showAnswer();\\n        }\\n      } else {\\n        // Number keys 1-5 for rating\\n        if (e.key >= '1' && e.key <= '5') {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          rateCard(parseInt(e.key));\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    \\n    // Navigation shortcuts\\n    if (e.altKey) {\\n      switch(e.key) {\\n        case '1':\\n          showView('study');\\n          break;\\n        case '2':\\n          showView('cards');\\n          break;\\n        case '3':\\n          showView('decks');\\n          break;\\n        case '4':\\n          showView('add');\\n          break;\\n        case '5':\\n          showView('stats');\\n          break;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  });\\n}\\n\\n// ==================== Study View ====================\\n\\nasync function loadDueCards() {\\n  try {\\n    let url = `${API_BASE}/api/cards/due`;\\n    if (currentDeckId) {\\n      url += `?deck=${currentDeckId}`;\\n    }\\n    \\n    const response = await fetch(url);\\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    \\n    if (result.success) {\\n      dueCards = result.data;\\n      currentCardIndex = 0;\\n      isAnswerShown = false;\\n      updateStudyProgress();\\n      \\n      if (dueCards.length > 0) {\\n        showCard();\\n      } else {\\n        showEmptyState();\\n      }\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to load due cards:', error);\\n    showToast('加载失败', 'error');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction updateStudyProgress() {\\n  const studied = currentCardIndex;\\n  const total = dueCards.length;\\n  document.getElementById('study-progress').textContent = `${studied} / ${total}`;\\n  document.getElementById('due-badge').textContent = total;\\n}\\n\\nfunction showCard() {\\n  isAnswerShown = false;\\n  \\n  const emptyState = document.getElementById('no-cards-message');\\n  const cardArea = document.getElementById('card-area');\\n  \\n  emptyState.style.display = 'none';\\n  cardArea.style.display = 'flex';\\n  cardArea.style.flexDirection = 'column';\\n  cardArea.style.alignItems = 'center';\\n  \\n  currentCard = dueCards[currentCardIndex];\\n  \\n  // Reset card display with animation\\n  const cardFront = document.getElementById('card-front');\\n  const cardBack = document.getElementById('card-back');\\n  \\n  cardFront.style.display = 'block';\\n  cardFront.style.animation = 'fadeIn 0.3s ease';\\n  cardBack.style.display = 'none';\\n  \\n  document.getElementById('show-answer-btn').style.display = 'inline-block';\\n  document.getElementById('rating-buttons').style.display = 'none';\\n  \\n  // Set card content\\n  document.getElementById('card-id').textContent = currentCard.id;\\n  document.getElementById('card-state').textContent = currentCard.state;\\n  document.getElementById('card-state').className = `card-state ${currentCard.state}`;\\n  document.getElementById('question-text').textContent = currentCard.question;\\n  document.getElementById('answer-text').textContent = currentCard.answer;\\n  \\n  // Update intervals preview\\n  updateIntervalPreview();\\n  \\n  // Focus the show answer button for accessibility\\n  document.getElementById('show-answer-btn').focus();\\n}\\n\\nasync function showAnswer() {\\n  isAnswerShown = true;\\n  \\n  // Fetch preview intervals from server\\n  try {\\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/review/${currentCard.id}/preview`);\\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    \\n    if (result.success) {\\n      const previews = result.data;\\n      document.getElementById('interval-1').textContent = previews[1] || '1m';\\n      document.getElementById('interval-2').textContent = previews[2] || '10m';\\n      document.getElementById('interval-3').textContent = previews[3] || '1d';\\n      document.getElementById('interval-4').textContent = previews[4] || '4d';\\n      document.getElementById('interval-5').textContent = previews[5] || '10d';\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to load preview:', error);\\n    // Fallback to calculated intervals\\n    const intervals = calculateIntervals(currentCard);\\n    document.getElementById('interval-1').textContent = intervals[0];\\n    document.getElementById('interval-2').textContent = intervals[1];\\n    document.getElementById('interval-3').textContent = intervals[2];\\n    document.getElementById('interval-4').textContent = intervals[3];\\n    document.getElementById('interval-5').textContent = intervals[4];\\n  }\\n  \\n  const cardFront = document.getElementById('card-front');\\n  const cardBack = document.getElementById('card-back');\\n  \\n  cardFront.style.display = 'none';\\n  cardBack.style.display = 'flex';\\n  cardBack.style.animation = 'fadeIn 0.3s ease';\\n  \\n  document.getElementById('show-answer-btn').style.display = 'none';\\n  document.getElementById('rating-buttons').style.display = 'flex';\\n  \\n  // Focus first rating button\\n  document.querySelector('.rating-btn').focus();\\n}\\n\\nfunction updateIntervalPreview() {\\n  // Calculate interval previews based on current card state\\n  const intervals = calculateIntervals(currentCard);\\n  \\n  document.getElementById('interval-1').textContent = intervals[0];\\n  document.getElementById('interval-2').textContent = intervals[1];\\n  document.getElementById('interval-3').textContent = intervals[2];\\n  document.getElementById('interval-4').textContent = intervals[3];\\n  document.getElementById('interval-5').textContent = intervals[4];\\n}\\n\\nfunction calculateIntervals(card) {\\n  let { interval, ease_factor, repetitions } = card;\\n  ease_factor = ease_factor || 2.5;\\n  interval = interval || 0;\\n  \\n  return [\\n    '1m',  // Again\\n    Math.max(1, Math.round(interval * 1.2)) + 'm',  // Hard\\n    repetitions === 0 ? '1d' : (repetitions === 1 ? '6d' : Math.round(interval * ease_factor) + 'd'),  // Good\\n    repetitions === 0 ? '4d' : Math.round(interval * ease_factor * 1.3) + 'd',  // Easy\\n    repetitions === 0 ? '10d' : Math.round(interval * ease_factor * 1.5) + 'd'  // Perfect\\n  ];\\n}\\n\\nasync function rateCard(rating) {\\n  try {\\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/review/${currentCard.id}`, {\\n      method: 'POST',\\n      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\\n      body: JSON.stringify({ rating })\\n    });\\n    \\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    \\n    if (result.success) {\\n      currentCardIndex++;\\n      updateStudyProgress();\\n      \\n      if (currentCardIndex < dueCards.length) {\\n        showCard();\\n      } else {\\n        // All cards reviewed\\n        showCompleteState();\\n      }\\n      \\n      // Update stats in background\\n      loadStats();\\n      loadDecks(); // Update deck due counts\\n      \\n      // Show toast with next interval\\n      showToast(`已评分 - 下次复习: ${result.nextInterval}`, 'success');\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to rate card:', error);\\n    showToast('评分失败', 'error');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction showEmptyState() {\\n  const container = document.getElementById('study-container');\\n  container.innerHTML = `\\n    <div class=\\\"empty-state\\\" id=\\\"no-cards-message\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"empty-icon\\\">🎉</div>\\n      <h2>太棒了！</h2>\\n      <p>${currentDeckId ? '这个牌组' : '今天'}没有需要复习的卡片了</p>\\n      <button class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" onclick=\\\"showView('add')\\\">添加新卡片</button>\\n    </div>\\n  `;\\n}\\n\\nfunction showCompleteState() {\\n  const container = document.getElementById('study-container');\\n  container.innerHTML = `\\n    <div class=\\\"empty-state\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"empty-icon\\\">🏆</div>\\n      <h2>完成！</h2>\\n      <p>恭喜完成今日复习</p>\\n      <button class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" onclick=\\\"showView('stats')\\\">查看统计</button>\\n    </div>\\n  `;\\n}\\n\\n// ==================== Cards List ====================\\n\\nasync function loadAllCards() {\\n  try {\\n    let url = `${API_BASE}/api/cards`;\\n    if (currentDeckId) {\\n      url += `?deck=${currentDeckId}`;\\n    }\\n    \\n    const response = await fetch(url);\\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    \\n    if (result.success) {\\n      allCards = result.data;\\n      renderCardsList();\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to load cards:', error);\\n    showToast('加载失败', 'error');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction renderCardsList() {\\n  const container = document.getElementById('cards-list');\\n  const searchTerm = document.getElementById('card-search').value.toLowerCase();\\n  \\n  const filteredCards = allCards.filter(card => \\n    card.question.toLowerCase().includes(searchTerm) ||\\n    card.answer.toLowerCase().includes(searchTerm)\\n  );\\n  \\n  if (filteredCards.length === 0) {\\n    container.innerHTML = `\\n      <div class=\\\"empty-state\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"empty-icon\\\">📭</div>\\n        <h2>没有找到卡片</h2>\\n        <p>${searchTerm ? '尝试其他搜索词' : '添加你的第一张卡片吧'}</p>\\n      </div>\\n    `;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  \\n  container.innerHTML = filteredCards.map(card => {\\n    const deck = allDecks.find(d => d.id === card.deck_id);\\n    return `\\n      <div class=\\\"card-item\\\" data-id=\\\"${card.id}\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card-item-content\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"card-item-header\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"card-item-id\\\">#${card.id}</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"card-item-deck\\\">${deck ? deck.name : '默认'}</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"card-item-state card-state ${card.state}\\\">${card.state}</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"card-item-question\\\">${escapeHtml(card.question)}</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"card-item-answer\\\">${escapeHtml(card.answer)}</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"card-item-meta\\\">\\n            <span>间隔: ${card.interval || 0}天</span>\\n            <span>复习: ${card.repetitions || 0}次</span>\\n            <span>难度: ${(card.ease_factor || 2.5).toFixed(2)}</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card-item-actions\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"btn-icon\\\" onclick=\\\"editCard(${card.id})\\\" title=\\\"编辑\\\">✏️</button>\\n          <button class=\\\"btn-icon danger\\\" onclick=\\\"confirmDelete(${card.id})\\\" title=\\\"删除\\\">🗑️</button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    `;\\n  }).join('');\\n}\\n\\nfunction filterCards() {\\n  renderCardsList();\\n}\\n\\nfunction escapeHtml(text) {\\n  const div = document.createElement('div');\\n  div.textContent = text;\\n  return div.innerHTML;\\n}\\n\\n// ==================== Add Card ====================\\n\\nasync function addCard() {\\n  const question = document.getElementById('question-input').value.trim();\\n  const answer = document.getElementById('answer-input').value.trim();\\n  const deckId = document.getElementById('deck-select-add').value;\\n  \\n  if (!question || !answer) {\\n    showToast('请填写问题和答案', 'error');\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  \\n  // Basic validation\\n  if (question.length > 1000 || answer.length > 5000) {\\n    showToast('输入内容过长', 'error');\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  \\n  try {\\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/cards`, {\\n      method: 'POST',\\n      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\\n      body: JSON.stringify({ \\n        question, \\n        answer,\\n        deck_id: deckId || 1\\n      })\\n    });\\n    \\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    \\n    if (result.success) {\\n      showToast('卡片添加成功', 'success');\\n      document.getElementById('question-input').value = '';\\n      document.getElementById('answer-input').value = '';\\n      loadStats();\\n      loadDecks();\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to add card:', error);\\n    showToast('添加失败', 'error');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nasync function quickAdd() {\\n  const input = document.getElementById('quick-add-input').value.trim();\\n  const deckId = document.getElementById('deck-select-add').value;\\n  \\n  if (!input) {\\n    showToast('请输入卡片内容', 'error');\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  \\n  const lines = input.split('\\\\n').filter(line => line.includes('::'));\\n  if (lines.length === 0) {\\n    showToast('格式错误，请使用 \\\"问题::答案\\\" 格式', 'error');\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  \\n  let successCount = 0;\\n  \\n  for (const line of lines) {\\n    const [question, answer] = line.split('::').map(s => s.trim());\\n    if (question && answer) {\\n      try {\\n        await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/cards`, {\\n          method: 'POST',\\n          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\\n          body: JSON.stringify({ \\n            question, \\n            answer,\\n            deck_id: deckId || 1\\n          })\\n        });\\n        successCount++;\\n      } catch (error) {\\n        console.error('Failed to add card:', error);\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  \\n  showToast(`成功添加 ${successCount} 张卡片`, 'success');\\n  document.getElementById('quick-add-input').value = '';\\n  loadStats();\\n  loadDecks();\\n}\\n\\n// ==================== Stats ====================\\n\\nasync function loadStats() {\\n  try {\\n    let url = `${API_BASE}/api/stats`;\\n    if (currentDeckId) {\\n      url += `?deck=${currentDeckId}`;\\n    }\\n    \\n    const response = await fetch(url);\\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    \\n    if (result.success) {\\n      const stats = result.data;\\n      \\n      // Update sidebar stats\\n      document.getElementById('total-cards').textContent = stats.total;\\n      document.getElementById('due-cards').textContent = stats.due;\\n      \\n      // Update stats view\\n      document.getElementById('stat-total').textContent = stats.total;\\n      document.getElementById('stat-due').textContent = stats.due;\\n      document.getElementById('stat-reviewed').textContent = stats.reviewed;\\n      document.getElementById('stat-new').textContent = stats.new;\\n      document.getElementById('stat-learning').textContent = stats.learning;\\n      document.getElementById('stat-ease').textContent = stats.avgEase;\\n      \\n      // Update progress bar\\n      const total = stats.total || 1;\\n      const newPercent = (stats.new / total) * 100;\\n      const learningPercent = (stats.learning / total) * 100;\\n      const reviewPercent = (stats.reviewed / total) * 100;\\n      \\n      document.getElementById('progress-new').style.width = `${newPercent}%`;\\n      document.getElementById('progress-learning').style.width = `${learningPercent}%`;\\n      document.getElementById('progress-review').style.width = `${reviewPercent}%`;\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to load stats:', error);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n// ==================== Delete Card ====================\\n\\nfunction confirmDelete(cardId) {\\n  document.getElementById('delete-modal').style.display = 'flex';\\n  document.getElementById('confirm-delete-btn').onclick = () => deleteCard(cardId);\\n}\\n\\nfunction closeModal() {\\n  document.getElementById('delete-modal').style.display = 'none';\\n}\\n\\nasync function deleteCard(cardId) {\\n  try {\\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/cards/${cardId}`, {\\n      method: 'DELETE'\\n    });\\n    \\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    \\n    if (result.success) {\\n      showToast('卡片已删除', 'success');\\n      closeModal();\\n      loadAllCards();\\n      loadStats();\\n      loadDecks();\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to delete card:', error);\\n    showToast('删除失败', 'error');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n// ==================== Edit Card ====================\\n\\nasync function editCard(cardId) {\\n  const card = allCards.find(c => c.id === cardId);\\n  if (!card) return;\\n  \\n  // Set deck selector\\n  document.getElementById('deck-select-add').value = card.deck_id;\\n  \\n  // Fill the add form with card data\\n  document.getElementById('question-input').value = card.question;\\n  document.getElementById('answer-input').value = card.answer;\\n  \\n  // Delete the old card\\n  await deleteCard(cardId);\\n  \\n  // Switch to add view\\n  showView('add');\\n  showToast('已复制到编辑区，请修改后重新添加', 'success');\\n}\\n\\n// ==================== Toast ====================\\n\\nfunction showToast(message, type = 'success') {\\n  const toast = document.getElementById('toast');\\n  toast.textContent = message;\\n  toast.className = `toast ${type} show`;\\n  \\n  setTimeout(() => {\\n    toast.classList.remove('show');\\n  }, 3000);\\n}\\n\\n// Make functions available globally\\nwindow.showView = showView;\\nwindow.showAnswer = showAnswer;\\nwindow.rateCard = rateCard;\\nwindow.addCard = addCard;\\nwindow.quickAdd = quickAdd;\\nwindow.filterCards = filterCards;\\nwindow.confirmDelete = confirmDelete;\\nwindow.closeModal = closeModal;\\nwindow.deleteCard = deleteCard;\\nwindow.editCard = editCard;\\nwindow.showToast = showToast;\\nwindow.toggleTheme = toggleTheme;\\nwindow.changeDeck = changeDeck;\\nwindow.showCreateDeckModal = showCreateDeckModal;\\nwindow.showEditDeckModal = showEditDeckModal;\\nwindow.closeDeckModal = closeDeckModal;\\nwindow.createDeck = createDeck;\\nwindow.updateDeck = updateDeck;\\nwindow.confirmDeleteDeck = confirmDeleteDeck;\\nwindow.deleteDeck = deleteDeck;\\nwindow.selectDeckAndStudy = selectDeckAndStudy;\\n\"}],\"isError\":false,\"timestamp\":1772158614048}}\n{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"b3e8de0e\",\"parentId\":\"e55595ab\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-02-27T02:18:21.831Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"现在我明白整个代码了。我需要修复两个问题：\\n\\n1. **loadDueCards 函数没有处理 API 返回 `success: false` 的情况** - 如果 API 返回错误，前端不会显示任何内容，用户看到的是空白屏幕，可能会误以为是\\\"加载失败\\\"。\\n\\n2. **添加卡片后没有自动刷新复习列表** - 用户添加卡片后，如果当前在复习视图，不会看到新卡片。\\n\\n让我修复这两个问题：\",\"thinkingSignature\":\"6a11b685affedefafddaa12a9213226144480f3e18d4f814e75513060ccd3466\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"我发现了问题！`loadDueCards` 函数没有处理 API 返回 `success: false` 的情况，这可能导致用户看到空白屏幕误以为是\\\"加载失败\\\"。同时，添加卡片后也没有刷新复习列表。\\n\\n让我修复这些问题：\\n\"},{\"type\":\"toolCall\",\"id\":\"call_function_9hng9yglzfm4_1\",\"name\":\"write\",\"arguments\":{\"content\":\"// FSRS Memory Web UI - Application Logic with Multi-deck & Theme support\\n\\nconst API_BASE = window.location.origin;\\n\\n// State\\nlet currentView = 'study';\\nlet currentDeckId = null;\\nlet dueCards = [];\\nlet allCards = [];\\nlet allDecks = [];\\nlet currentCardIndex = 0;\\nlet currentCard = null;\\nlet isAnswerShown = false;\\nlet currentTheme = 'light';\\n\\n// ==================== Initialization ====================\\n\\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\\n  initTheme();\\n  initNavigation();\\n  initKeyboardShortcuts();\\n  loadDecks();\\n  loadStats();\\n  loadDueCards();\\n});\\n\\n// ==================== Theme ====================\\n\\nasync function initTheme() {\\n  try {\\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/settings/theme`);\\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    if (result.success) {\\n      currentTheme = result.data || 'light';\\n      applyTheme(currentTheme);\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to load theme:', error);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction applyTheme(theme) {\\n  document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', theme);\\n  document.getElementById('theme-icon').textContent = theme === 'dark' ? '☀️' : '🌙';\\n  currentTheme = theme;\\n}\\n\\nasync function toggleTheme() {\\n  const newTheme = currentTheme === 'light' ? 'dark' : 'light';\\n  try {\\n    await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/settings/theme`, {\\n      method: 'POST',\\n      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\\n      body: JSON.stringify({ theme: newTheme })\\n    });\\n    applyTheme(newTheme);\\n    showToast(`已切换到${newTheme === 'dark' ? '暗色' : '亮色'}主题`, 'success');\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to save theme:', error);\\n    showToast('主题切换失败', 'error');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n// ==================== Navigation ====================\\n\\nfunction initNavigation() {\\n  const navItems = document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item');\\n  navItems.forEach(item => {\\n    item.addEventListener('click', () => {\\n      const view = item.dataset.view;\\n      showView(view);\\n    });\\n  });\\n}\\n\\nfunction showView(view) {\\n  // Update nav\\n  document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item').forEach(item => {\\n    item.classList.toggle('active', item.dataset.view === view);\\n  });\\n  \\n  // Update view\\n  document.querySelectorAll('.view').forEach(v => {\\n    v.classList.toggle('active', v.id === `${view}-view`);\\n  });\\n  \\n  currentView = view;\\n  \\n  // Load data for specific views\\n  if (view === 'study') {\\n    loadDueCards();\\n  } else if (view === 'cards') {\\n    loadAllCards();\\n  } else if (view === 'decks') {\\n    loadDecksGrid();\\n  } else if (view === 'stats') {\\n    loadStats();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n// ==================== Deck Management ====================\\n\\nasync function loadDecks() {\\n  try {\\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/decks`);\\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    \\n    if (result.success) {\\n      allDecks = result.data;\\n      updateDeckSelectors();\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to load decks:', error);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction updateDeckSelectors() {\\n  // Update sidebar deck selector\\n  const sidebarSelect = document.getElementById('deck-select');\\n  const addViewSelect = document.getElementById('deck-select-add');\\n  \\n  const options = allDecks.map(deck => \\n    `<option value=\\\"${deck.id}\\\">${deck.name} (${deck.due_count || 0} 待复习)</option>`\\n  ).join('');\\n  \\n  sidebarSelect.innerHTML = '<option value=\\\"\\\">全部牌组</option>' + options;\\n  addViewSelect.innerHTML = options;\\n  \\n  // Set default selection\\n  if (allDecks.length > 0 && !currentDeckId) {\\n    addViewSelect.value = allDecks[0].id;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nasync function changeDeck(deckId) {\\n  currentDeckId = deckId ? parseInt(deckId) : null;\\n  \\n  // Update deck info in study view\\n  const deckInfo = document.getElementById('deck-info');\\n  if (currentDeckId) {\\n    const deck = allDecks.find(d => d.id === currentDeckId);\\n    deckInfo.textContent = `当前牌组: ${deck ? deck.name : ''}`;\\n  } else {\\n    deckInfo.textContent = '';\\n  }\\n  \\n  // Reload data\\n  if (currentView === 'study') {\\n    loadDueCards();\\n  } else if (currentView === 'cards') {\\n    loadAllCards();\\n  } else if (currentView === 'stats') {\\n    loadStats();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nasync function loadDecksGrid() {\\n  try {\\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/decks`);\\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    \\n    if (result.success) {\\n      renderDecksGrid(result.data);\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to load decks:', error);\\n    showToast('加载失败', 'error');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction renderDecksGrid(decks) {\\n  const container = document.getElementById('decks-grid');\\n  \\n  container.innerHTML = decks.map(deck => `\\n    <div class=\\\"deck-card\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"deck-card-header\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"deck-card-name\\\">${escapeHtml(deck.name)}</div>\\n        ${deck.id === 1 ? '<span class=\\\"deck-card-default\\\">默认</span>' : ''}\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"deck-card-desc\\\">${escapeHtml(deck.description || '暂无描述')}</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"deck-card-stats\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"deck-stat\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"deck-stat-value\\\">${deck.card_count || 0}</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"deck-stat-label\\\">卡片数</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"deck-stat\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"deck-stat-value\\\">${deck.due_count || 0}</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"deck-stat-label\\\">待复习</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"deck-card-actions\\\">\\n        <button class=\\\"btn btn-secondary btn-small\\\" onclick=\\\"showEditDeckModal(${deck.id})\\\">编辑</button>\\n        ${deck.id !== 1 ? `<button class=\\\"btn btn-danger btn-small\\\" onclick=\\\"confirmDeleteDeck(${deck.id})\\\">删除</button>` : ''}\\n        <button class=\\\"btn btn-primary btn-small\\\" onclick=\\\"selectDeckAndStudy(${deck.id})\\\">学习</button>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  `).join('');\\n}\\n\\nfunction showCreateDeckModal() {\\n  document.getElementById('deck-modal-title').textContent = '新建牌组';\\n  document.getElementById('deck-name-input').value = '';\\n  document.getElementById('deck-desc-input').value = '';\\n  document.getElementById('save-deck-btn').onclick = createDeck;\\n  document.getElementById('deck-modal').style.display = 'flex';\\n}\\n\\nfunction showEditDeckModal(deckId) {\\n  const deck = allDecks.find(d => d.id === deckId);\\n  if (!deck) return;\\n  \\n  document.getElementById('deck-modal-title').textContent = '编辑牌组';\\n  document.getElementById('deck-name-input').value = deck.name;\\n  document.getElementById('deck-desc-input').value = deck.description || '';\\n  document.getElementById('save-deck-btn').onclick = () => updateDeck(deckId);\\n  document.getElementById('deck-modal').style.display = 'flex';\\n}\\n\\nfunction closeDeckModal() {\\n  document.getElementById('deck-modal').style.display = 'none';\\n}\\n\\nasync function createDeck() {\\n  const name = document.getElementById('deck-name-input').value.trim();\\n  const description = document.getElementById('deck-desc-input').value.trim();\\n  \\n  if (!name) {\\n    showToast('请输入牌组名称', 'error');\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  \\n  try {\\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/decks`, {\\n      method: 'POST',\\n      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\\n      body: JSON.stringify({ name, description })\\n    });\\n    \\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    \\n    if (result.success) {\\n      showToast('牌组创建成功', 'success');\\n      closeDeckModal();\\n      loadDecks();\\n      loadDecksGrid();\\n    } else {\\n      showToast(result.error || '创建失败', 'error');\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to create deck:', error);\\n    showToast('创建失败', 'error');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nasync function updateDeck(deckId) {\\n  const name = document.getElementById('deck-name-input').value.trim();\\n  const description = document.getElementById('deck-desc-input').value.trim();\\n  \\n  if (!name) {\\n    showToast('请输入牌组名称', 'error');\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  \\n  try {\\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/decks/${deckId}`, {\\n      method: 'PUT',\\n      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\\n      body: JSON.stringify({ name, description })\\n    });\\n    \\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    \\n    if (result.success) {\\n      showToast('牌组更新成功', 'success');\\n      closeDeckModal();\\n      loadDecks();\\n      loadDecksGrid();\\n    } else {\\n      showToast(result.error || '更新失败', 'error');\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to update deck:', error);\\n    showToast('更新失败', 'error');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction confirmDeleteDeck(deckId) {\\n  if (confirm('确定要删除这个牌组吗？该牌组中的卡片将移动到默认牌组。')) {\\n    deleteDeck(deckId);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nasync function deleteDeck(deckId) {\\n  try {\\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/decks/${deckId}`, {\\n      method: 'DELETE'\\n    });\\n    \\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    \\n    if (result.success) {\\n      showToast('牌组已删除', 'success');\\n      loadDecks();\\n      loadDecksGrid();\\n      loadStats();\\n    } else {\\n      showToast(result.error || '删除失败', 'error');\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to delete deck:', error);\\n    showToast('删除失败', 'error');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction selectDeckAndStudy(deckId) {\\n  document.getElementById('deck-select').value = deckId;\\n  changeDeck(deckId);\\n  showView('study');\\n}\\n\\n// ==================== Keyboard Shortcuts ====================\\n\\nfunction initKeyboardShortcuts() {\\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\\n    // Don't trigger shortcuts when typing in inputs\\n    if (e.target.tagName === 'INPUT' || e.target.tagName === 'TEXTAREA' || e.target.tagName === 'SELECT') {\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    \\n    // Study view shortcuts\\n    if (currentView === 'study' && dueCards.length > 0) {\\n      if (!isAnswerShown) {\\n        // Space or Enter to show answer\\n        if (e.code === 'Space' || e.code === 'Enter') {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          showAnswer();\\n        }\\n      } else {\\n        // Number keys 1-5 for rating\\n        if (e.key >= '1' && e.key <= '5') {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          rateCard(parseInt(e.key));\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    \\n    // Navigation shortcuts\\n    if (e.altKey) {\\n      switch(e.key) {\\n        case '1':\\n          showView('study');\\n          break;\\n        case '2':\\n          showView('cards');\\n          break;\\n        case '3':\\n          showView('decks');\\n          break;\\n        case '4':\\n          showView('add');\\n          break;\\n        case '5':\\n          showView('stats');\\n          break;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  });\\n}\\n\\n// ==================== Study View ====================\\n\\nasync function loadDueCards() {\\n  try {\\n    let url = `${API_BASE}/api/cards/due`;\\n    if (currentDeckId) {\\n      url += `?deck=${currentDeckId}`;\\n    }\\n    \\n    const response = await fetch(url);\\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    \\n    // Handle API error response\\n    if (!result.success) {\\n      console.error('API error:', result.error);\\n      showToast(result.error || '加载失败', 'error');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    \\n    dueCards = result.data;\\n    currentCardIndex = 0;\\n    isAnswerShown = false;\\n    updateStudyProgress();\\n    \\n    if (dueCards.length > 0) {\\n      showCard();\\n    } else {\\n      showEmptyState();\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to load due cards:', error);\\n    showToast('加载失败', 'error');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction updateStudyProgress() {\\n  const studied = currentCardIndex;\\n  const total = dueCards.length;\\n  document.getElementById('study-progress').textContent = `${studied} / ${total}`;\\n  document.getElementById('due-badge').textContent = total;\\n}\\n\\nfunction showCard() {\\n  isAnswerShown = false;\\n  \\n  const emptyState = document.getElementById('no-cards-message');\\n  const cardArea = document.getElementById('card-area');\\n  \\n  emptyState.style.display = 'none';\\n  cardArea.style.display = 'flex';\\n  cardArea.style.flexDirection = 'column';\\n  cardArea.style.alignItems = 'center';\\n  \\n  currentCard = dueCards[currentCardIndex];\\n  \\n  // Reset card display with animation\\n  const cardFront = document.getElementById('card-front');\\n  const cardBack = document.getElementById('card-back');\\n  \\n  cardFront.style.display = 'block';\\n  cardFront.style.animation = 'fadeIn 0.3s ease';\\n  cardBack.style.display = 'none';\\n  \\n  document.getElementById('show-answer-btn').style.display = 'inline-block';\\n  document.getElementById('rating-buttons').style.display = 'none';\\n  \\n  // Set card content\\n  document.getElementById('card-id').textContent = currentCard.id;\\n  document.getElementById('card-state').textContent = currentCard.state;\\n  document.getElementById('card-state').className = `card-state ${currentCard.state}`;\\n  document.getElementById('question-text').textContent = currentCard.question;\\n  document.getElementById('answer-text').textContent = currentCard.answer;\\n  \\n  // Update intervals preview\\n  updateIntervalPreview();\\n  \\n  // Focus the show answer button for accessibility\\n  document.getElementById('show-answer-btn').focus();\\n}\\n\\nasync function showAnswer() {\\n  isAnswerShown = true;\\n  \\n  // Fetch preview intervals from server\\n  try {\\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/review/${currentCard.id}/preview`);\\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    \\n    if (result.success) {\\n      const previews = result.data;\\n      document.getElementById('interval-1').textContent = previews[1] || '1m';\\n      document.getElementById('interval-2').textContent = previews[2] || '10m';\\n      document.getElementById('interval-3').textContent = previews[3] || '1d';\\n      document.getElementById('interval-4').textContent = previews[4] || '4d';\\n      document.getElementById('interval-5').textContent = previews[5] || '10d';\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to load preview:', error);\\n    // Fallback to calculated intervals\\n    const intervals = calculateIntervals(currentCard);\\n    document.getElementById('interval-1').textContent = intervals[0];\\n    document.getElementById('interval-2').textContent = intervals[1];\\n    document.getElementById('interval-3').textContent = intervals[2];\\n    document.getElementById('interval-4').textContent = intervals[3];\\n    document.getElementById('interval-5').textContent = intervals[4];\\n  }\\n  \\n  const cardFront = document.getElementById('card-front');\\n  const cardBack = document.getElementById('card-back');\\n  \\n  cardFront.style.display = 'none';\\n  cardBack.style.display = 'flex';\\n  cardBack.style.animation = 'fadeIn 0.3s ease';\\n  \\n  document.getElementById('show-answer-btn').style.display = 'none';\\n  document.getElementById('rating-buttons').style.display = 'flex';\\n  \\n  // Focus first rating button\\n  document.querySelector('.rating-btn').focus();\\n}\\n\\nfunction updateIntervalPreview() {\\n  // Calculate interval previews based on current card state\\n  const intervals = calculateIntervals(currentCard);\\n  \\n  document.getElementById('interval-1').textContent = intervals[0];\\n  document.getElementById('interval-2').textContent = intervals[1];\\n  document.getElementById('interval-3').textContent = intervals[2];\\n  document.getElementById('interval-4').textContent = intervals[3];\\n  document.getElementById('interval-5').textContent = intervals[4];\\n}\\n\\nfunction calculateIntervals(card) {\\n  let { interval, ease_factor, repetitions } = card;\\n  ease_factor = ease_factor || 2.5;\\n  interval = interval || 0;\\n  \\n  return [\\n    '1m',  // Again\\n    Math.max(1, Math.round(interval * 1.2)) + 'm',  // Hard\\n    repetitions === 0 ? '1d' : (repetitions === 1 ? '6d' : Math.round(interval * ease_factor) + 'd'),  // Good\\n    repetitions === 0 ? '4d' : Math.round(interval * ease_factor * 1.3) + 'd',  // Easy\\n    repetitions === 0 ? '10d' : Math.round(interval * ease_factor * 1.5) + 'd'  // Perfect\\n  ];\\n}\\n\\nasync function rateCard(rating) {\\n  try {\\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/review/${currentCard.id}`, {\\n      method: 'POST',\\n      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\\n      body: JSON.stringify({ rating })\\n    });\\n    \\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    \\n    if (result.success) {\\n      currentCardIndex++;\\n      updateStudyProgress();\\n      \\n      if (currentCardIndex < dueCards.length) {\\n        showCard();\\n      } else {\\n        // All cards reviewed\\n        showCompleteState();\\n      }\\n      \\n      // Update stats in background\\n      loadStats();\\n      loadDecks(); // Update deck due counts\\n      \\n      // Show toast with next interval\\n      showToast(`已评分 - 下次复习: ${result.nextInterval}`, 'success');\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to rate card:', error);\\n    showToast('评分失败', 'error');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction showEmptyState() {\\n  const container = document.getElementById('study-container');\\n  container.innerHTML = `\\n    <div class=\\\"empty-state\\\" id=\\\"no-cards-message\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"empty-icon\\\">🎉</div>\\n      <h2>太棒了！</h2>\\n      <p>${currentDeckId ? '这个牌组' : '今天'}没有需要复习的卡片了</p>\\n      <button class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" onclick=\\\"showView('add')\\\">添加新卡片</button>\\n    </div>\\n  `;\\n}\\n\\nfunction showCompleteState() {\\n  const container = document.getElementById('study-container');\\n  container.innerHTML = `\\n    <div class=\\\"empty-state\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"empty-icon\\\">🏆</div>\\n      <h2>完成！</h2>\\n      <p>恭喜完成今日复习</p>\\n      <button class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" onclick=\\\"showView('stats')\\\">查看统计</button>\\n    </div>\\n  `;\\n}\\n\\n// ==================== Cards List ====================\\n\\nasync function loadAllCards() {\\n  try {\\n    let url = `${API_BASE}/api/cards`;\\n    if (currentDeckId) {\\n      url += `?deck=${currentDeckId}`;\\n    }\\n    \\n    const response = await fetch(url);\\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    \\n    if (result.success) {\\n      allCards = result.data;\\n      renderCardsList();\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to load cards:', error);\\n    showToast('加载失败', 'error');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction renderCardsList() {\\n  const container = document.getElementById('cards-list');\\n  const searchTerm = document.getElementById('card-search').value.toLowerCase();\\n  \\n  const filteredCards = allCards.filter(card => \\n    card.question.toLowerCase().includes(searchTerm) ||\\n    card.answer.toLowerCase().includes(searchTerm)\\n  );\\n  \\n  if (filteredCards.length === 0) {\\n    container.innerHTML = `\\n      <div class=\\\"empty-state\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"empty-icon\\\">📭</div>\\n        <h2>没有找到卡片</h2>\\n        <p>${searchTerm ? '尝试其他搜索词' : '添加你的第一张卡片吧'}</p>\\n      </div>\\n    `;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  \\n  container.innerHTML = filteredCards.map(card => {\\n    const deck = allDecks.find(d => d.id === card.deck_id);\\n    return `\\n      <div class=\\\"card-item\\\" data-id=\\\"${card.id}\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card-item-content\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"card-item-header\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"card-item-id\\\">#${card.id}</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"card-item-deck\\\">${deck ? deck.name : '默认'}</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"card-item-state card-state ${card.state}\\\">${card.state}</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"card-item-question\\\">${escapeHtml(card.question)}</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"card-item-answer\\\">${escapeHtml(card.answer)}</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"card-item-meta\\\">\\n            <span>间隔: ${card.interval || 0}天</span>\\n            <span>复习: ${card.repetitions || 0}次</span>\\n            <span>难度: ${(card.ease_factor || 2.5).toFixed(2)}</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card-item-actions\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"btn-icon\\\" onclick=\\\"editCard(${card.id})\\\" title=\\\"编辑\\\">✏️</button>\\n          <button class=\\\"btn-icon danger\\\" onclick=\\\"confirmDelete(${card.id})\\\" title=\\\"删除\\\">🗑️</button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    `;\\n  }).join('');\\n}\\n\\nfunction filterCards() {\\n  renderCardsList();\\n}\\n\\nfunction escapeHtml(text) {\\n  const div = document.createElement('div');\\n  div.textContent = text;\\n  return div.innerHTML;\\n}\\n\\n// ==================== Add Card ====================\\n\\nasync function addCard() {\\n  const question = document.getElementById('question-input').value.trim();\\n  const answer = document.getElementById('answer-input').value.trim();\\n  const deckId = document.getElementById('deck-select-add').value;\\n  \\n  if (!question || !answer) {\\n    showToast('请填写问题和答案', 'error');\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  \\n  // Basic validation\\n  if (question.length > 1000 || answer.length > 5000) {\\n    showToast('输入内容过长', 'error');\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  \\n  try {\\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/cards`, {\\n      method: 'POST',\\n      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\\n      body: JSON.stringify({ \\n        question, \\n        answer,\\n        deck_id: deckId || 1\\n      })\\n    });\\n    \\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    \\n    if (result.success) {\\n      showToast('卡片添加成功', 'success');\\n      document.getElementById('question-input').value = '';\\n      document.getElementById('answer-input').value = '';\\n      loadStats();\\n      loadDecks();\\n      // Refresh due cards if in study view to show newly added card\\n      if (currentView === 'study') {\\n        loadDueCards();\\n      }\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to add card:', error);\\n    showToast('添加失败', 'error');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nasync function quickAdd() {\\n  const input = document.getElementById('quick-add-input').value.trim();\\n  const deckId = document.getElementById('deck-select-add').value;\\n  \\n  if (!input) {\\n    showToast('请输入卡片内容', 'error');\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  \\n  const lines = input.split('\\\\n').filter(line => line.includes('::'));\\n  if (lines.length === 0) {\\n    showToast('格式错误，请使用 \\\"问题::答案\\\" 格式', 'error');\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  \\n  let successCount = 0;\\n  \\n  for (const line of lines) {\\n    const [question, answer] = line.split('::').map(s => s.trim());\\n    if (question && answer) {\\n      try {\\n        await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/cards`, {\\n          method: 'POST',\\n          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\\n          body: JSON.stringify({ \\n            question, \\n            answer,\\n            deck_id: deckId || 1\\n          })\\n        });\\n        successCount++;\\n      } catch (error) {\\n        console.error('Failed to add card:', error);\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  \\n  showToast(`成功添加 ${successCount} 张卡片`, 'success');\\n  document.getElementById('quick-add-input').value = '';\\n  loadStats();\\n  loadDecks();\\n  // Refresh due cards if in study view to show newly added cards\\n  if (currentView === 'study') {\\n    loadDueCards();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n// ==================== Stats ====================\\n\\nasync function loadStats() {\\n  try {\\n    let url = `${API_BASE}/api/stats`;\\n    if (currentDeckId) {\\n      url += `?deck=${currentDeckId}`;\\n    }\\n    \\n    const response = await fetch(url);\\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    \\n    if (result.success) {\\n      const stats = result.data;\\n      \\n      // Update sidebar stats\\n      document.getElementById('total-cards').textContent = stats.total;\\n      document.getElementById('due-cards').textContent = stats.due;\\n      \\n      // Update stats view\\n      document.getElementById('stat-total').textContent = stats.total;\\n      document.getElementById('stat-due').textContent = stats.due;\\n      document.getElementById('stat-reviewed').textContent = stats.reviewed;\\n      document.getElementById('stat-new').textContent = stats.new;\\n      document.getElementById('stat-learning').textContent = stats.learning;\\n      document.getElementById('stat-ease').textContent = stats.avgEase;\\n      \\n      // Update progress bar\\n      const total = stats.total || 1;\\n      const newPercent = (stats.new / total) * 100;\\n      const learningPercent = (stats.learning / total) * 100;\\n      const reviewPercent = (stats.reviewed / total) * 100;\\n      \\n      document.getElementById('progress-new').style.width = `${newPercent}%`;\\n      document.getElementById('progress-learning').style.width = `${learningPercent}%`;\\n      document.getElementById('progress-review').style.width = `${reviewPercent}%`;\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to load stats:', error);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n// ==================== Delete Card ====================\\n\\nfunction confirmDelete(cardId) {\\n  document.getElementById('delete-modal').style.display = 'flex';\\n  document.getElementById('confirm-delete-btn').onclick = () => deleteCard(cardId);\\n}\\n\\nfunction closeModal() {\\n  document.getElementById('delete-modal').style.display = 'none';\\n}\\n\\nasync function deleteCard(cardId) {\\n  try {\\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/cards/${cardId}`, {\\n      method: 'DELETE'\\n    });\\n    \\n    const result = await response.json();\\n    \\n    if (result.success) {\\n      showToast('卡片已删除', 'success');\\n      closeModal();\\n      loadAllCards();\\n      loadStats();\\n      loadDecks();\\n    }\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    console.error('Failed to delete card:', error);\\n    showToast('删除失败', 'error');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n// ==================== Edit Card ====================\\n\\nasync function editCard(cardId) {\\n  const card = allCards.find(c => c.id === cardId);\\n  if (!card) return;\\n  \\n  // Set deck selector\\n  document.getElementById('deck-select-add').value = card.deck_id;\\n  \\n  // Fill the add form with card data\\n  document.getElementById('question-input').value = card.question;\\n  document.getElementById('answer-input').value = card.answer;\\n  \\n  // Delete the old card\\n  await deleteCard(cardId);\\n  \\n  // Switch to add view\\n  showView('add');\\n  showToast('已复制到编辑区，请修改后重新添加', 'success');\\n}\\n\\n// ==================== Toast ====================\\n\\nfunction showToast(message, type = 'success') {\\n  const toast = document.getElementById('toast');\\n  toast.textContent = message;\\n  toast.className = `toast ${type} show`;\\n  \\n  setTimeout(() => {\\n    toast.classList.remove('show');\\n  }, 3000);\\n}\\n\\n// Make functions available globally\\nwindow.showView = showView;\\nwindow.showAnswer = showAnswer;\\nwindow.rateCard = rateCard;\\nwindow.addCard = addCard;\\nwindow.quickAdd = quickAdd;\\nwindow.filterCards = filterCards;\\nwindow.confirmDelete = confirmDelete;\\nwindow.closeModal = closeModal;\\nwindow.deleteCard = deleteCard;\\nwindow.editCard = editCard;\\nwindow.showToast = showToast;\\nwindow.toggleTheme = toggleTheme;\\nwindow.changeDeck = changeDeck;\\nwindow.showCreateDeckModal = showCreateDeckModal;\\nwindow.showEditDeckModal = showEditDeckModal;\\nwindow.closeDeckModal = closeDeckModal;\\nwindow.createDeck = createDeck;\\nwindow.updateDeck = updateDeck;\\nwindow.confirmDeleteDeck = confirmDeleteDeck;\\nwindow.deleteDeck = deleteDeck;\\nwindow.selectDeckAndStudy = selectDeckAndStudy;\\n\",\"path\":\"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/public/app.js\"}}],\"api\":\"anthropic-messages\",\"provider\":\"minimax-portal\",\"model\":\"MiniMax-M2.5\",\"usage\":{\"input\":36346,\"output\":6839,\"cacheRead\":7777,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"totalTokens\":50962,\"cost\":{\"input\":0,\"output\":0,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"total\":0}},\"stopReason\":\"toolUse\",\"timestamp\":1772158614052}}\n{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"55b608a7\",\"parentId\":\"b3e8de0e\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-02-27T02:18:21.852Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"toolResult\",\"toolCallId\":\"call_function_9hng9yglzfm4_1\",\"toolName\":\"write\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Successfully wrote 25876 bytes to /home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/public/app.js\"}],\"isError\":false,\"timestamp\":1772158701849}}\n{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"45be8377\",\"parentId\":\"55b608a7\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-02-27T02:18:46.523Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"我修改了两个地方：\\n\\n1. **loadDueCards 函数** - 添加了对 `result.success === false` 的处理：\\n```javascript\\n// Handle API error response\\nif (!result.success) {\\n  console.error('API error:', result.error);\\n  showToast(result.error || '加载失败', 'error');\\n  return;\\n}\\n```\\n\\n2. **addCard 函数** - 在添加卡片后，如果当前在复习视图，会自动刷新复习列表：\\n```javascri