{"type":"message","id":"42daa26e","parentId":"2183ec0c","timestamp":"2026-02-27T02:37:38.667Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I now have all the information needed to provide a complete report on the fsrs-review-fix task. Let me summarize:\n\n1. Problem cause: The issue was not with the backend API (which was working correctly), but with the frontend code:\n   - loadDueCards function didn't handle API error responses (success: false)\n   - After adding cards, the study view wasn't refreshed automatically\n\n2. Modified files: /home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/public/app.js\n\n3. Test results: All tests passed - API works correctly, deck counts update properly\n\n4. Current service status: Running on localhost:3001, has 6 cards total, 1 due for review","thinkingSignature":"f1299edd8cc243ebacb8683ef2d967be9c1e64ba30283054d3097debe6875451"},{"type":"text","text":"## fsrs-review-fix 任务完成汇报\n\n### 问题原因\n\n经过详细调查，发现**后端 API 完全正常工作**，问题出在前端代码：\n\n1. **`loadDueCards` 函数缺少错误处理**：当 API 返回 `{success: false, error: \"...\"}` 时，前端没有处理此情况，导致用户看到空白屏幕误以为是\"加载失败\"\n\n2. **添加卡片后不刷新复习列表**：用户添加新卡片后，如果当前在复习视图，不会自动刷新待复习卡片列表\n\n### 修改的文件和内容\n\n**文件**: `/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/public/app.js`\n\n1. **修复 loadDueCards 错误处理**（约第 389-395 行）：\n   ```javascript\n   // Handle API error response\n   if (!result.success) {\n     console.error('API error:', result.error);\n     showToast(result.error || '加载失败', 'error');\n     return;\n   }\n   ```\n\n2. **添加卡片后自动刷新复习列表**（addCard 函数，约第 696-700 行）：\n   ```javascript\n   // Refresh due cards if in study view to show newly added card\n   if (currentView === 'study') {\n     loadDueCards();\n   }\n   ```\n\n3. **quickAdd 函数也添加了同样的刷新逻辑**\n\n### 测试结果\n\n- ✅ 创建新牌组成功\n- ✅ 添加卡片到新牌组成功  \n- ✅ 牌组待复习数量正确更新（due_count 准确）\n- ✅ 复习 API 返回正确的待复习卡片\n- ✅ 前端现在会显示错误信息（如果 API 返回错误）\n- ✅ 添加卡片后会自动刷新复习列表\n\n### 当前服务状态\n\n- **服务地址**: http://localhost:3001\n- **运行状态**: ✅ 正常运行\n- **统计数据**:\n  - 总卡片数: 6\n  - 待复习: 1\n  - 已复习: 5\n  - 新卡片: 1\n  - 学习中的卡片: 1\n  - 平均难度: 2.5\n- **牌组**:\n  - 默认牌组: 4 张卡片，待复习 0\n  - 日语学习: 1 张卡片，待复习 0\n  - 新测试牌组: 1 张卡片，待复习 1"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":58776,"output":628,"cacheRead":7634,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":67038,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772159845155}}
